DESIGN STUDY

The generative study design/identity/isoline-assembly.html is a modified
version of the viewer template (templates/viewer.html) of the "algorithmic-art"
skill, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the same
licence as this project; see LICENSE). The algorithm, its parameters and their
controls were replaced, and the colour variables were renamed; the layout,
seed controls, fonts and colour values are the template's. When opened, the
study loads p5.js (LGPL 2.1) from a CDN and two typefaces from Google Fonts.
The application itself does not include or load p5.js or those typefaces.
